2026-11-06T02:58:53.7237412Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7237964Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7238708Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7239333Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7239889Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7248878Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7249728Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7259382Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7260461Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T02:58:53.7260949Z 
